    ["Dear Beyonder: \nCongratulations on reaching level 62! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Lord of Mysteries!"] = "Dear Потусторонний: \nCongratulations on reaching level 62! We have prepared level rewards for you to use for testing and progression in this version. Please claim them! We wish you a pleasant adventure in the world of Повелитель Тайн!",
